// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch20 U01 layer 1, Ilun (Asha), the arrival. act3_ch20.md §2 U01; vowbound §1.
// Memory: Oruvel's market hull at noon (Ch1), the cookboats, the scale-hull; held shapes buying and selling (they don't
// speak to the party: rule 3). §10 Q2 default: Kell's stall stands with someone at it, back turned, trimming wicks;
// Rhen sees it and doesn't go over. No line. Imra and Dace are not seen in Ch20 (rule 5).
title: ch20_ilun
location: ch20/undertow_layers
---
@letterbox on
@camera U04
@music memory_oruvel fade=3.0
@vfx glimmer_held at=market_shapes count=60 rate=slow
@wait 5.0
@camera U05
@anim rhen look_at kell_stall
@wait 4.0
@anim rhen turn_to asha
@wait 2.0
@camera U06
@anim ilun rise market_water
@wait 3.0
@letterbox off
<<event start_battle ch20_ilun>>
===
